    <sys:String x:Key="ChkPaceMode">Show speed as pace (min/km) instead of km/h</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GrpGradient">Gradient colouring (active track)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="DescGradient">The gradient metric is chosen from the Gradient dropdown on the toolbar. It draws the selected track with a red (fast / easy / descending) → blue (slow / hard / climbing) gradient along its segments; other tracks keep their own colour. Segments with no pavement information are treated as unpaved.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LblGradeUnit">Grade unit:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GradePercent">Percent (%)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GradeDegree">Degrees (°)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="DescGradeUnit">Unit for the inclination legend labels (the slope shown at the red and blue ends). Percent is rise/run; degrees is the equivalent slope angle.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GrpAutoRoute">Auto-route (drawing)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ChkRouteSimplify">Simplify routed legs</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LblTolerance">Tolerance:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LblToleranceSuffix">metres  (larger = fewer points)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="DescAutoRoute">Auto-route on/off and the routing profile are chosen from the Route dropdown on the toolbar. Routing uses the public BRouter service (brouter.de) — no API key. When a route can't be found the new point is joined with a straight segment.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LblElevationSources">Elevation sources</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ChkSrtm">SRTM .hgt tiles (local, offline)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LblSrtmFolder">Folder containing .hgt tiles (e.g. N54E025.hgt):</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ChkSrtmAuto">Download missing tiles automatically</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="ChkOnline">Online elevation service (fallback for missing points)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LblProvider">Provider:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LblDataset">OpenTopoData dataset:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="DescOnline">Requires network access. Public services are rate-limited (OpenTopoData: 100 points/request, ~1 request/second, 1000/day). Used only to fill points SRTM could not provide.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="GrpServer">Server storage</sys:String>
